        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ICE</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, ICE
The data is based on the bulk material composition of an ICE, The life span of the lis assumed to be 25 years resulting in a life time performance of 10 Mio. vkm ;
UUID: 876cb063-8b88-4171-94d0-ca1e388c1b91
The inventory includes waste treatment processes for non metal components of an ICEtrain composition. For the transport of disposed materials standard distances have been applied.
Location: Data represents Swiss disposal conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data based on the material composition of an ICE. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_876cb063-8b88-4171-94d0-ca1e388c1b91.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
